    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d18688eddf654c334bcb30a7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与其说是优等生……不如说是变幻莫测呢。\r\n时时刻刻都观察着周围，思考着自己应该采取怎\r\n样的对策……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94e1ef9aa723c6e991bd5bb0ba44c3bd690d617f95f57c309ff427bb05646746",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
