    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08ad6954c3f5a1b6b1d164c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并非是将自己的意志强加在环境之上，\r\n而是让自己的意志随环境而改变。\r\n让我也受益匪浅呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "726159b96300b057b14d25c64d814b3093ea21f5ec3ab49fdde08ceaf77769f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
