    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8620382cd6935940c1f5b783",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实况",
      "source_fingerprint": "50349a592c466fb97eeafeb81fd3fa65c8c3b2e779463937300c4c8f97230140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62b37357f68e0bf9acaa0ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙！！击碎马群所筑的高墙，\r\n穿过暴风所封锁的绝境！而今日——\r\n她攀过名为距离的高峰，达成三冠——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c497fa4210c84476dc9d9a115c335f7fd5067097a8c73bd6ba1df7981e962b34",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fe46912f594eb3af4d39d4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0792fd0379a39459c76fdd07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今后也将……“共存”了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f0dc55fb4efc66d0b04f09fb1eb37463da07ebf8939ff7355a94514fa5e2511",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38364c395f82cfbc918ae352",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙成为了新的三冠赛马娘——\r\n而这也意味着，她也将要肩负起相应的责任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f028a0e7c92b34f7f76e7771c0c31acb9c1235251549f904c2fc42f252042a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:038d4140559a5281d5c24492",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着，当晚——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1a6c554f798388df57c4a8dc2a7c027c140d57086c0d758a8fc3b5eb89dce69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5eff133731afbf8554143e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢谢关心。关于这个嘛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a626a2685732872d0b90f922b402550f2fdb8a765eb0f3f8d3cf03336da33aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:511c152a30dc89d56d43bece",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15eaa460df46174afac59890",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员。新宇宙有件事情很『担心』。\r\n关于训练员的资格……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64c23d975db657a49c20f8730d9eeb8bf929d40443a3b5b1e2089710f18fade",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26560e5baad6f814bec20db9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我告诉她，『已经想办法解决了』。\r\n毕竟我的行为也并非是出于恶意……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bfbc2f25ed573c4c9542aae23674cf5d6166d266a1bd6cebfa0268b9ab4e51f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28fcf13bc330630c1b57969c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后的处置结果只是简单的批评教育。\r\nURA也并不是什么毫无人情味的组织啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de5544aa849b4b68bdcd84cfaaeacb4634442279ec93a8ea780000b0e48df35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dd4c03de8dc3225fc848d94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b240a577fe7b8e4ba466e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样吗……\r\n那么，这个“星间宙域”——通过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a92064746c9f98a4c86318fcf96ef0033c5b224d3102591e75159aa3cbc36b01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:682088e0e25b52b78e4c3d6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在经历这一次历练之后，\r\n我感觉我与新宇宙的情谊进一步加深了。\r\n照这个状态的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f8a3cc778d901e9af0e16177aca99833d69f73071dec735d24e60fe1a0f9fd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
