      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以心传心。\r\n看她的表情，大概也是想在『天皇赏（春）』之\r\n前先参加一场别的比赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30f9a845bf370529eb33d8c68f6b6de5c67e577fea5bff77feda7eacc61ef72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
