    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4295b66c004bf9b657d125ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f297853ef1b1b7db68c78ec4d2b8a22265e660e6d8cfc87bc1e707b608964801",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78ebfa8b0de25d79782425c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时至今日，已经无需多言。\r\n共同前进，一路走到今天——\r\n我们遭遇了多少苦难，只有对方最为清楚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b77f63a483ae73dc882c4e1bdf22d6f0d157bf1c35057c204b4b87b96886c916",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12e11b2a47a5436712cf1a1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在她苍蓝的双瞳之中，记载着这一切的故事。\r\n就在此时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3503c592c8388b077d81c9a2a8ee42d8576d211ab89b15744fb0e407ca4a049",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f813f6fdf3a1eac273cbe215",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花賞の後に・知性の三冠ウマ娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "832cab74d365fb38ab4581f0940afcd82c140216d8e1565781a43173b7616e6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29ea5bc17f464c69a6a69a8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便将来无法再担任她的训练员，\r\n我也不会后悔。\r\n——经典三冠的最后，可没有“下一次”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "957b2e620e1b93619d6e598a952afe178d5618e560d95ffa7a9091f0d9b735c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:813cc9060d261eccc2d62288",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为——我已经在这最后的舞台之上，\r\n见证了新宇宙的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc7541f6b858dfa599eae68a607b8e256963c73e0abe83e7541832b3a40d6c0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73bc4ecf4b572a133ecdea03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢谢关心。关于这个嘛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a626a2685732872d0b90f922b402550f2fdb8a765eb0f3f8d3cf03336da33aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
