    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a04671e28d81a80cb83150d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我告诉她，『已经想办法解决了』。\r\n毕竟我的行为也并非是出于恶意……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bfbc2f25ed573c4c9542aae23674cf5d6166d266a1bd6cebfa0268b9ab4e51f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105313.json",
      "json_path": [
