    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58f8c26193bacb4045696029",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在经历这一次历练之后，\r\n我感觉我与新宇宙的情谊进一步加深了。\r\n照这个状态的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f8a3cc778d901e9af0e16177aca99833d69f73071dec735d24e60fe1a0f9fd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105313.json",
      "json_path": [
